{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The B-2 \u201cSpirit\u201d was designed to penetrate dense anti-aircraft defenses to deliver both conventional and nuclear munitions.  Its low-observable \u2013 also known as \u201cstealth\u201d \u2013 characteristics come from a unique combination of its flying-wing design, special coatings, and other innovative aspects that remain classified to this day.  The E-flite\u00ae Micro B-2 Spirit of America Twin 30mm EDF is a replica of the iconic bomber that's scaled to be affordable and practical for more RC pilots to own and fly!  It's compatible with popular 3S 850mAh batteries and is equipped with exclusive Spektrum\u2122 AS3X plus optional-use SAFE Select technologies to make it the easiest to fly B-2 yet.  Optional-use fixed landing gear with a steerable nose wheel makes it easy to taxi, take off from, and land on smooth surfaces, or you can leave the landing gear off for more speed and performance when flying over grass.  Best of all, it arrives factory-finished and ready to fly right out of the box to offer an authentic but surprisingly fun stealth bomber flying experience you can't get anywhere else!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483070?t=1758740909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483070?t=1758740909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483070/aad0bb47e9cdc2713bce48faf6780b5613d32871/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758740909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483070/aad0bb47e9cdc2713bce48faf6780b5613d32871/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758740909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The B-2 \u201cSpirit\u201d was designed to penetrate dense anti-aircraft defenses to deliver both conventional and nuclear munitions.  Its low-observable \u2013 also known as \u201cstealth\u201d \u2013 characteristics come from a unique combination of its flying-wing design, special coatings, and other innovative aspects that remain classified to this day.  The E-flite\u00ae Micro B-2 Spirit of America Twin 30mm EDF is a replica of the iconic bomber that's scaled to be affordable and practical for more RC pilots to own and fly!  It's compatible with popular 3S 850mAh batteries and is equipped with exclusive Spektrum\u2122 AS3X plus optional-use SAFE Select technologies to make it the easiest to fly B-2 yet.  Optional-use fixed landing gear with a steerable nose wheel makes it easy to taxi, take off from, and land on smooth surfaces, or you can leave the landing gear off for more speed and performance when flying over grass.  Best of all, it arrives factory-finished and ready to fly right out of the box to offer an authentic but surprisingly fun stealth bomber flying experience you can't get anywhere else!</p>","developers":["Horizon Hobby, LLC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2069310","name":"RealFlight Evolution"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483070/398656291d842984c8cc95e4356a0908850a30fd/header.jpg?t=1758740909","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All DLC content \u00a9 2025, Horizon Hobby, LLC.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Reco